  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The man in the suit is mapped as the entity trying to send killers to kill Dante in Dante's Inferno",
  "description": "The text 'tries to send killers to kill dante in dantes inferno' is overlaid on the image of the man in a suit. The meme uses this juxtaposition to imply that the man (a figure of authority or bureaucracy) is so incompetent or out of touch that he would attempt an absurd, impossible task — sending killers to kill Dante Alighieri within his own literary work, 'Dante's Inferno'. This creates an analogical mapping where the man is being satirically equated with the 'entity' described in the text, which is a fictional, bureaucratic, or incompetent actor attempting an impossible action.",
